graph TD
    Start([User Modifies Vitals / Profile]) --> CheckNet{Is Network Connected?<br/>connectivity_plus}
    
    CheckNet -- Online --> DirectAPI[Dispatch Immediate HTTPS Request to Cloud Backend]
    DirectAPI --> ServerAck{Server Responded 200 OK?}
    ServerAck -- Yes --> UpdateLocalCache[Update Local Drift SQLite Database & Clear Dirty Flag]
    ServerAck -- No --> MarkDirty[Write to Local SQLite & Set sync_status = 'pending']
    
    CheckNet -- Offline --> LocalWrite[Insert into Local Drift DB with sync_status = 'pending']
    LocalWrite --> NotifyUser[Display 'Saved Locally - Offline Mode' Banner]
    
    NotifyUser --> Listener[Network Listener Detects Connection Restored]
    MarkDirty --> Listener
    Listener --> QueryQueue[SELECT * FROM records WHERE sync_status = 'pending']
    QueryQueue --> DispatchBatch[Post Queued Records in Monotonic Timestamp Order]
    DispatchBatch --> ResolveConflicts{Server Conflict Detected?}
    ResolveConflicts -- No --> MarkSynced[Update sync_status = 'synced']
    ResolveConflicts -- Yes --> ClientWins[Client Monotonic Timestamp Resolution Policy]
    ClientWins --> MarkSynced
    MarkSynced --> Complete([Offline Synchronization Complete])
